    "updated_at": "2023-03-30T19:17:14Z",
    "body": "The new test in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/38875 implicitly requires TransformStream to be created with the caller realm, which doesn't match with Gecko's `this` behavior. Perhaps we should finally get some normative spec here.\r\n\r\nThat said, what should happen when creating a promise with a detached realm?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
