    "updated_at": "2023-03-31T00:47:06Z",
    "body": "The intent of the test is that it be created in the realm of the constructor. Probably we should add some comments.\r\n\r\n*Edit:* Incidentally, the point of the test is that Chromium fails it, so we haven't actually tested the success case. The Chromium-only test https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/web_tests/wpt_internal/streams/transform-streams/invalid-realm.window.js documents our actual behaviour.",
